From a70a1923d2d957b1d81f28833845dbdda0530fb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "gastown.slit (polecat)" <polecat-gastown.slit@soundit.local>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 23:14:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add billing:backfill-prepaid-time command for historical
 invoice lines
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Backfill prepaid_time_minutes on historical PSA-native invoice lines from
linked SKU configuration, mirroring BillingService's generation-time formula
(quantity × sku.prepaid_time_minutes). Only fills lines never set (null), so
intentional values are never clobbered; scoped to PSA-native invoices by
default (--include-halo to widen).

Optional --deposit-paid reconciles already-paid invoices whose lines gained
prepaid time (the InvoiceObserver only auto-deposits on the Paid transition,
so historical paid invoices never deposited). Reuses the idempotent, guarded
PrepayService::depositFromInvoice(), so re-runs never double-deposit. --dry-run
previews both steps.

Closes psa-hb9. GitHub #107.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
